### Create a deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-11111",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-11111",
  "toAccount": "ACC-22222",
  "amount": 750.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-22222",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Invalid transaction (validation error)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "BAD-FORMAT",
  "amount": -10.999,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Get all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-11111

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?from=2026-03-01&to=2026-04-30

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-11111&type=transfer

### Get transaction by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/replace-with-actual-id

### Update transaction status (replace with actual ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/transactions/replace-with-actual-id/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Get account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-11111/balance

### Get account summary
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-11111/summary

### Calculate simple interest (5% rate, 30 days)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-11111/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### Export transactions as CSV
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/export?format=csv
